      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Service Gateway — بوابة الخدمات (الحوكمة التنفيذية)\nEVERY tool call the agent makes passes through here:\n1) the skill's `allowed_services` allowlist is enforced from the signed registry — a call outside the list returns SERVICE_DENIED_BY_GOVERNANCE;\n2) every call (including denials) writes an AuditLog row.\nThe agent cannot touch data any other way. (Criteria ①⑤⑥)",
        "width": 640,
